Installation

Requires Perl v5.42.0 or later and the SDL3 library with its Perl bindings.

    perl Build.PL
    ./Build installdeps    # optional: installs missing prerequisites
    ./Build
    ./Build test
    ./Build install

Both bin/operation-rebuild and sbin/operation-rebuild-server are installed
into the normal script directory.

Games::Dice::Advanced

Operation Rebuild needs a Games::Dice::Advanced with a "rand" option (so rolls
can be repeated from a seed) and keep/drop notation such as 4d6kh3. Both have
been submitted upstream but are not in a release yet (the released 1.2 lacks
them). Until they are, install the fork:

    cpanm --reinstall https://github.com/lschierer/perl-modules-Games-Dice-Advanced/archive/refs/heads/keep-drop-dice.tar.gz

The game checks this at startup and says so if the wrong version is installed.
This section goes away once a release contains the changes.
